[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.179",
    "end": "00:00:02.480",
    "start_seconds": 0.179,
    "end_seconds": 2.48,
    "text": "How do you start a conversation and make friends?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:02.480",
    "end": "00:00:03.480",
    "start_seconds": 2.48,
    "end_seconds": 3.48,
    "text": "I'm Chad Littlefield."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.480",
    "end": "00:00:07.329",
    "start_seconds": 3.48,
    "end_seconds": 7.329,
    "text": "I co-wrote a book called Ask Powerful Questions Create Conversations That Matter."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:07.329",
    "end": "00:00:12.970",
    "start_seconds": 7.329,
    "end_seconds": 12.97,
    "text": "And in this video, I'm going to share one of my absolute favorite methods to make conversation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.970",
    "end": "00:00:17.620",
    "start_seconds": 12.97,
    "end_seconds": 17.62,
    "text": "that can be used even in the most extreme circumstances --an elevator."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.620",
    "end": "00:00:18.860",
    "start_seconds": 17.62,
    "end_seconds": 18.86,
    "text": "Classically awkward scenario."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.860",
    "end": "00:00:20.840",
    "start_seconds": 18.86,
    "end_seconds": 20.84,
    "text": "You can use it in many other scenarios."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.840",
    "end": "00:00:23.460",
    "start_seconds": 20.84,
    "end_seconds": 23.46,
    "text": "But I want to share it in the context of using an elevator."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.460",
    "end": "00:00:27.240",
    "start_seconds": 23.46,
    "end_seconds": 27.24,
    "text": "Because if you can make conversation happen in an elevator, you can make conversation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.240",
    "end": "00:00:29.610",
    "start_seconds": 27.24,
    "end_seconds": 29.61,
    "text": "happen in a whole bunch of other context."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.610",
    "end": "00:00:37.930",
    "start_seconds": 29.61,
    "end_seconds": 37.93,
    "text": "I will also share 2 traps that people often fall into when they try to make conversation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.930",
    "end": "00:00:43.830",
    "start_seconds": 37.93,
    "end_seconds": 43.83,
    "text": "Let's get into it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.830",
    "end": "00:00:48.690",
    "start_seconds": 43.83,
    "end_seconds": 48.69,
    "text": "Alright."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.690",
    "end": "00:00:50.850",
    "start_seconds": 48.69,
    "end_seconds": 50.85,
    "text": "I'm not a fan of fluff unless it's a sandwich."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.850",
    "end": "00:00:52.260",
    "start_seconds": 50.85,
    "end_seconds": 52.26,
    "text": "So, let's dive right in."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.260",
    "end": "00:00:57.640",
    "start_seconds": 52.26,
    "end_seconds": 57.64,
    "text": "The book is structured in this Ask Powerful Questions pyramid with multiple different"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.640",
    "end": "00:01:04.670",
    "start_seconds": 57.64,
    "end_seconds": 64.67,
    "text": "skills and mindsets to be able to create conversations that matter, I want to zoom right in on chapter"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.670",
    "end": "00:01:07.680",
    "start_seconds": 64.67,
    "end_seconds": 67.68,
    "text": "number 2 on this idea of rapport."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.680",
    "end": "00:01:13.530",
    "start_seconds": 67.68,
    "end_seconds": 73.53,
    "text": "Which Will and I define as a creating a relationship of trust with another human being."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.530",
    "end": "00:01:19.890",
    "start_seconds": 73.53,
    "end_seconds": 79.89,
    "text": "And specifically, the tool that we share is to follow your natural genuine curiosity based"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.890",
    "end": "00:01:24.430",
    "start_seconds": 79.89,
    "end_seconds": 84.43,
    "text": "on something that the other person is wearing, carrying, or sharing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.430",
    "end": "00:01:25.869",
    "start_seconds": 84.43,
    "end_seconds": 85.869,
    "text": "So, that could be a lot of stuff."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.869",
    "end": "00:01:29.170",
    "start_seconds": 85.869,
    "end_seconds": 89.17,
    "text": "So, imagine we're in an elevator, strangers walked in..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.170",
    "end": "00:01:34.030",
    "start_seconds": 89.17,
    "end_seconds": 94.03,
    "text": "Actually, we need a stranger."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.030",
    "end": "00:01:41.880",
    "start_seconds": 94.03,
    "end_seconds": 101.88,
    "text": "So, imagine that you're just trapped in an elevator with a stranger and all you have"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41.880",
    "end": "00:01:46.670",
    "start_seconds": 101.88,
    "end_seconds": 106.67,
    "text": "to create conversation is what exists in that little metal box."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.670",
    "end": "00:01:51.369",
    "start_seconds": 106.67,
    "end_seconds": 111.369,
    "text": "Using this tool to follow your actual genuine curiosity based on something that you see"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.369",
    "end": "00:01:57.140",
    "start_seconds": 111.369,
    "end_seconds": 117.14,
    "text": "that they're wearing, carrying, sharing, or presenting."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.140",
    "end": "00:02:02.720",
    "start_seconds": 117.14,
    "end_seconds": 122.72,
    "text": "And the reason this tool is so powerful is that even though an elevator is usually silent,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:02.720",
    "end": "00:02:03.720",
    "start_seconds": 122.72,
    "end_seconds": 123.72,
    "text": "right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.720",
    "end": "00:02:07.170",
    "start_seconds": 123.72,
    "end_seconds": 127.17,
    "text": "It's like a narrative that's classic awkward elevator music playing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.170",
    "end": "00:02:08.690",
    "start_seconds": 127.17,
    "end_seconds": 128.69,
    "text": "Usually, an elevator is silent."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.690",
    "end": "00:02:13.099",
    "start_seconds": 128.69,
    "end_seconds": 133.099,
    "text": "I would say that the conversation is already 5 paragraph deep when you walk in because"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.099",
    "end": "00:02:17.919",
    "start_seconds": 133.099,
    "end_seconds": 137.919,
    "text": "when this person walked out into the world or they turned up in a zoom call, they knew"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.919",
    "end": "00:02:19.459",
    "start_seconds": 137.919,
    "end_seconds": 139.459,
    "text": "that they're going to be in public."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19.459",
    "end": "00:02:24.409",
    "start_seconds": 139.459,
    "end_seconds": 144.409,
    "text": "And so, they put things on their body to choose to represent or say something in some way,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.409",
    "end": "00:02:25.409",
    "start_seconds": 144.409,
    "end_seconds": 145.409,
    "text": "right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.409",
    "end": "00:02:29.819",
    "start_seconds": 145.409,
    "end_seconds": 149.819,
    "text": "And so, if you're in an all-gray sweatsuit and you didn't do your hair, you're probably"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.819",
    "end": "00:02:31.760",
    "start_seconds": 149.819,
    "end_seconds": 151.76,
    "text": "saying, \"I don't care right now\", right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.760",
    "end": "00:02:32.959",
    "start_seconds": 151.76,
    "end_seconds": 152.959,
    "text": "And that's presenting something."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.959",
    "end": "00:02:36.510",
    "start_seconds": 152.959,
    "end_seconds": 156.51,
    "text": "It creates an opportunity for you to be curious."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.510",
    "end": "00:02:37.949",
    "start_seconds": 156.51,
    "end_seconds": 157.949,
    "text": "And most of the time..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.949",
    "end": "00:02:40.950",
    "start_seconds": 157.949,
    "end_seconds": 160.95,
    "text": "Now, there's always risk when you're going to start a conversation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.950",
    "end": "00:02:45.450",
    "start_seconds": 160.95,
    "end_seconds": 165.45,
    "text": "But most of the time, the risk here is fairly low because they knew that they're going to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.450",
    "end": "00:02:46.450",
    "start_seconds": 165.45,
    "end_seconds": 166.45,
    "text": "put this on."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.450",
    "end": "00:02:48.699",
    "start_seconds": 166.45,
    "end_seconds": 168.699,
    "text": "I knew that I was going to have a wedding ring when I was shooting today."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.699",
    "end": "00:02:52.689",
    "start_seconds": 168.699,
    "end_seconds": 172.689,
    "text": "And so, if you're asking about my wedding ring, what's the story behind my wedding ring,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.689",
    "end": "00:02:56.480",
    "start_seconds": 172.689,
    "end_seconds": 176.48,
    "text": "I would have some really interesting things to share with you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.480",
    "end": "00:02:59.450",
    "start_seconds": 176.48,
    "end_seconds": 179.45,
    "text": "And I told you something without even saying a word."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.450",
    "end": "00:03:04.599",
    "start_seconds": 179.45,
    "end_seconds": 184.599,
    "text": "And so, based on people's necklaces or clothes or t-shirt that they're wearing, a hat."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.599",
    "end": "00:03:07.209",
    "start_seconds": 184.599,
    "end_seconds": 187.209,
    "text": "But also, something that could be in their surroundings all well."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.209",
    "end": "00:03:09.260",
    "start_seconds": 187.209,
    "end_seconds": 189.26,
    "text": "So, what do you see in their space?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.260",
    "end": "00:03:13.010",
    "start_seconds": 189.26,
    "end_seconds": 193.01,
    "text": "Is there something that you can reference or ask about?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.010",
    "end": "00:03:15.249",
    "start_seconds": 193.01,
    "end_seconds": 195.249,
    "text": "Ask to that person but it's in that shared space."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.249",
    "end": "00:03:18.889",
    "start_seconds": 195.249,
    "end_seconds": 198.889,
    "text": "So, there's a poster up on the wall and in an elevator."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.889",
    "end": "00:03:21.989",
    "start_seconds": 198.889,
    "end_seconds": 201.989,
    "text": "Being able to spark a conversation based on a poster on a wall or something that shared"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.989",
    "end": "00:03:27.950",
    "start_seconds": 201.989,
    "end_seconds": 207.95,
    "text": "in space is much safer or more organic than if you were to say..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.950",
    "end": "00:03:30.989",
    "start_seconds": 207.95,
    "end_seconds": 210.989,
    "text": "You don't spark a conversation out of nowhere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.989",
    "end": "00:03:32.709",
    "start_seconds": 210.989,
    "end_seconds": 212.709,
    "text": "And say like, \"Hey..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.709",
    "end": "00:03:36.310",
    "start_seconds": 212.709,
    "end_seconds": 216.31,
    "text": "What do you think of the game last night?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.310",
    "end": "00:03:37.310",
    "start_seconds": 216.31,
    "end_seconds": 217.31,
    "text": "Right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.310",
    "end": "00:03:38.310",
    "start_seconds": 217.31,
    "end_seconds": 218.31,
    "text": "It's not in the elevator."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.310",
    "end": "00:03:42.709",
    "start_seconds": 218.31,
    "end_seconds": 222.709,
    "text": "And so, when you bring it in, it has a much higher potential chance of being awkward."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.709",
    "end": "00:03:45.390",
    "start_seconds": 222.709,
    "end_seconds": 225.39,
    "text": "So, quick example or tip to help us work better too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:45.390",
    "end": "00:03:51.219",
    "start_seconds": 225.39,
    "end_seconds": 231.219,
    "text": "If I were to ask my friend here a question like \"Why are you so 2-faced?\", right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.219",
    "end": "00:03:53.059",
    "start_seconds": 231.219,
    "end_seconds": 233.059,
    "text": "You hear the amount of judgment in that question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.059",
    "end": "00:03:54.609",
    "start_seconds": 233.059,
    "end_seconds": 234.609,
    "text": "I would argue that there's..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.609",
    "end": "00:03:58.469",
    "start_seconds": 234.609,
    "end_seconds": 238.469,
    "text": "It feels like there's a lot of judgment in that question because it begins with the word"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.469",
    "end": "00:03:59.469",
    "start_seconds": 238.469,
    "end_seconds": 239.469,
    "text": "why."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.469",
    "end": "00:04:03.639",
    "start_seconds": 239.469,
    "end_seconds": 243.639,
    "text": "So, a really great question tend to begin with \"how\" or \"what\" and not \"why\"."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.639",
    "end": "00:04:06.979",
    "start_seconds": 243.639,
    "end_seconds": 246.979,
    "text": "I explain that in some other videos that you can check out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.979",
    "end": "00:04:12.930",
    "start_seconds": 246.979,
    "end_seconds": 252.93,
    "text": "But a better question might be, \"Hey, what inspired the 2-tone paint job today?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.930",
    "end": "00:04:17.259",
    "start_seconds": 252.93,
    "end_seconds": 257.259,
    "text": "You see there's a little bit less judgment and a little bit more genuine curiosity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.259",
    "end": "00:04:22.150",
    "start_seconds": 257.259,
    "end_seconds": 262.15,
    "text": "If you want to start really great conversations and make friends, you want curiosity to be"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:22.150",
    "end": "00:04:24.610",
    "start_seconds": 262.15,
    "end_seconds": 264.61,
    "text": "high and judgment to be very low."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.610",
    "end": "00:04:27.229",
    "start_seconds": 264.61,
    "end_seconds": 267.229,
    "text": "Now, before you jump off this video and you're like, \"Cool tool!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.229",
    "end": "00:04:28.229",
    "start_seconds": 267.229,
    "end_seconds": 268.229,
    "text": "Let me go practice it.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.229",
    "end": "00:04:34.870",
    "start_seconds": 268.229,
    "end_seconds": 274.87,
    "text": "Let me share 2 traps that people commonly fall into when they try to use this idea to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.870",
    "end": "00:04:38.259",
    "start_seconds": 274.87,
    "end_seconds": 278.259,
    "text": "build a relationship with trust and make conversation with somebody new."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.259",
    "end": "00:04:42.509",
    "start_seconds": 278.259,
    "end_seconds": 282.509,
    "text": "The first trap is that people go curiosity shopping."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.509",
    "end": "00:04:44.700",
    "start_seconds": 282.509,
    "end_seconds": 284.7,
    "text": "And so, they look around and say, \"Ohh..\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.700",
    "end": "00:04:46.620",
    "start_seconds": 284.7,
    "end_seconds": 286.62,
    "text": "And so, Steven who's filming right now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.620",
    "end": "00:04:48.520",
    "start_seconds": 286.62,
    "end_seconds": 288.52,
    "text": "\"Steven, what a nice shirt."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.520",
    "end": "00:04:50.600",
    "start_seconds": 288.52,
    "end_seconds": 290.6,
    "text": "That's so beautiful\", right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.600",
    "end": "00:04:51.699",
    "start_seconds": 290.6,
    "end_seconds": 291.699,
    "text": "And when I do that..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.699",
    "end": "00:04:53.139",
    "start_seconds": 291.699,
    "end_seconds": 293.139,
    "text": "That's cool."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.139",
    "end": "00:04:55.189",
    "start_seconds": 293.139,
    "end_seconds": 295.189,
    "text": "But it's not going to start a conversation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.189",
    "end": "00:04:56.580",
    "start_seconds": 295.189,
    "end_seconds": 296.58,
    "text": "It's actually a conversation ender."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:56.580",
    "end": "00:04:58.800",
    "start_seconds": 296.58,
    "end_seconds": 298.8,
    "text": "Because it's a sentence that ends with a period."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.800",
    "end": "00:05:04.699",
    "start_seconds": 298.8,
    "end_seconds": 304.699,
    "text": "And so, you have to turn your shopping or your compliments into a question or else,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.699",
    "end": "00:05:06.689",
    "start_seconds": 304.699,
    "end_seconds": 306.689,
    "text": "there is no conversation to be had."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.689",
    "end": "00:05:11.939",
    "start_seconds": 306.689,
    "end_seconds": 311.939,
    "text": "By the way, the idea is not to just to talk about Steven's shirt or my friend's 2-tone"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.939",
    "end": "00:05:14.080",
    "start_seconds": 311.939,
    "end_seconds": 314.08,
    "text": "face forever."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.080",
    "end": "00:05:18.169",
    "start_seconds": 314.08,
    "end_seconds": 318.169,
    "text": "The idea behind this tool is that when that person answers that question even with a few"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.169",
    "end": "00:05:22.500",
    "start_seconds": 318.169,
    "end_seconds": 322.5,
    "text": "sentences, you're going to learn 3, 4, 5, 6 other things that you can be curious about."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.500",
    "end": "00:05:24.860",
    "start_seconds": 322.5,
    "end_seconds": 324.86,
    "text": "Because conversation is very exponential, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.860",
    "end": "00:05:26.680",
    "start_seconds": 324.86,
    "end_seconds": 326.68,
    "text": "It's going to span out from there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:26.680",
    "end": "00:05:27.810",
    "start_seconds": 326.68,
    "end_seconds": 327.81,
    "text": "Trap number 2."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.810",
    "end": "00:05:29.210",
    "start_seconds": 327.81,
    "end_seconds": 329.21,
    "text": "Big words."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.210",
    "end": "00:05:31.539",
    "start_seconds": 329.21,
    "end_seconds": 331.539,
    "text": "Self-disclosure versus countertransference."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.539",
    "end": "00:05:33.620",
    "start_seconds": 331.539,
    "end_seconds": 333.62,
    "text": "Oh, my goodness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:33.620",
    "end": "00:05:38.830",
    "start_seconds": 333.62,
    "end_seconds": 338.83,
    "text": "So, self-disclosure, first of all, a conversation without self-disclosure is actually an interrogation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.830",
    "end": "00:05:39.830",
    "start_seconds": 338.83,
    "end_seconds": 339.83,
    "text": "Right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.830",
    "end": "00:05:44.450",
    "start_seconds": 339.83,
    "end_seconds": 344.45,
    "text": "So, if I'm sitting here question, question, question, question, question, question, question,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.450",
    "end": "00:05:48.039",
    "start_seconds": 344.45,
    "end_seconds": 348.039,
    "text": "question, that is not a great way to meet someboy else."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.039",
    "end": "00:05:51.990",
    "start_seconds": 348.039,
    "end_seconds": 351.99,
    "text": "And so, being mindful of using this tool to follow your curiosity but also empathetic"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.990",
    "end": "00:05:57.229",
    "start_seconds": 351.99,
    "end_seconds": 357.229,
    "text": "enough to know when it's appropriate to share and make a little bit of self-disclosure happen"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:57.229",
    "end": "00:05:59.229",
    "start_seconds": 357.229,
    "end_seconds": 359.229,
    "text": "between you and that person."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.229",
    "end": "00:06:01.629",
    "start_seconds": 359.229,
    "end_seconds": 361.629,
    "text": "Countertransference is a psychological term."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.629",
    "end": "00:06:03.870",
    "start_seconds": 361.629,
    "end_seconds": 363.87,
    "text": "I had a mentor who was a counseling psychologist."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.870",
    "end": "00:06:05.259",
    "start_seconds": 363.87,
    "end_seconds": 365.259,
    "text": "His name is Jeff."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:05.259",
    "end": "00:06:09.009",
    "start_seconds": 365.259,
    "end_seconds": 369.009,
    "text": "He's a beautiful human being and he wrote a book about countertransference."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.009",
    "end": "00:06:13.520",
    "start_seconds": 369.009,
    "end_seconds": 373.52,
    "text": "Countertransference is basically the idea that when in a counseling relationship, that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.520",
    "end": "00:06:19.319",
    "start_seconds": 373.52,
    "end_seconds": 379.319,
    "text": "when you are in a conversation and the councilor..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.319",
    "end": "00:06:22.099",
    "start_seconds": 379.319,
    "end_seconds": 382.099,
    "text": "You say something that actually triggers the councilor."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.099",
    "end": "00:06:26.030",
    "start_seconds": 382.099,
    "end_seconds": 386.03,
    "text": "And they start projecting potentially their emotions onto you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.030",
    "end": "00:06:28.229",
    "start_seconds": 386.03,
    "end_seconds": 388.229,
    "text": "And so, you want to be mindful."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:28.229",
    "end": "00:06:32.340",
    "start_seconds": 388.229,
    "end_seconds": 392.34000000000003,
    "text": "If you get really excited about what somebody shared because you have some commonality with"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:32.340",
    "end": "00:06:33.340",
    "start_seconds": 392.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 393.34000000000003,
    "text": "it, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:33.340",
    "end": "00:06:35.969",
    "start_seconds": 393.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 395.969,
    "text": "If you find out that they're scuba divers, your tendency is going to be to say, \"Oh,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.969",
    "end": "00:06:38.629",
    "start_seconds": 395.969,
    "end_seconds": 398.629,
    "text": "I'm a scuba diver too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:38.629",
    "end": "00:06:40.159",
    "start_seconds": 398.629,
    "end_seconds": 400.159,
    "text": "Can we be friends?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:40.159",
    "end": "00:06:42.659",
    "start_seconds": 400.159,
    "end_seconds": 402.659,
    "text": "And that's not the ideal to do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.659",
    "end": "00:06:45.030",
    "start_seconds": 402.659,
    "end_seconds": 405.03,
    "text": "The ideal thing to do is \"Cool, that's a commonality."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:45.030",
    "end": "00:06:46.030",
    "start_seconds": 405.03,
    "end_seconds": 406.03,
    "text": "That's really cool.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.030",
    "end": "00:06:48.820",
    "start_seconds": 406.03,
    "end_seconds": 408.82,
    "text": "Keep that in the D-L for a little bit."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.820",
    "end": "00:06:51.969",
    "start_seconds": 408.82,
    "end_seconds": 411.969,
    "text": "And just be curious about their favorite scuba dive that they went on."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:51.969",
    "end": "00:06:54.229",
    "start_seconds": 411.969,
    "end_seconds": 414.229,
    "text": "Be curious about some of their experiences scuba diving."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.229",
    "end": "00:06:59.419",
    "start_seconds": 414.229,
    "end_seconds": 419.419,
    "text": "And it some point, it'll make total sense to reveal and self-disclose that you also"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.419",
    "end": "00:07:02.909",
    "start_seconds": 419.419,
    "end_seconds": 422.909,
    "text": "scuba dive and they'll be this beautiful connection that happens."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.909",
    "end": "00:07:07.909",
    "start_seconds": 422.909,
    "end_seconds": 427.909,
    "text": "If you like this video, I make them because I believe that conversation should matter"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.909",
    "end": "00:07:10.849",
    "start_seconds": 427.909,
    "end_seconds": 430.849,
    "text": "in conversations that don't matter shouldn't be had."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:10.849",
    "end": "00:07:12.881",
    "start_seconds": 430.849,
    "end_seconds": 432.881,
    "text": "And so, Me and Will wrote a book all about it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.881",
    "end": "00:07:15.189",
    "start_seconds": 432.881,
    "end_seconds": 435.189,
    "text": "Feel free to go on Amazon and check it out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:15.189",
    "end": "00:07:17.219",
    "start_seconds": 435.189,
    "end_seconds": 437.219,
    "text": "But I also believe information should be free."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:17.219",
    "end": "00:07:18.759",
    "start_seconds": 437.219,
    "end_seconds": 438.759,
    "text": "So, paper does cost money."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.759",
    "end": "00:07:23.749",
    "start_seconds": 438.759,
    "end_seconds": 443.749,
    "text": "But below, you can grab a free link to an excerpt of the book to unpack in your own"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.749",
    "end": "00:07:24.749",
    "start_seconds": 443.749,
    "end_seconds": 444.749,
    "text": "time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:24.749",
    "end": "00:07:28.729",
    "start_seconds": 444.749,
    "end_seconds": 448.729,
    "text": "The free excerpt shares the first chapter of the book which really lays the foundation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.729",
    "end": "00:07:31.279",
    "start_seconds": 448.729,
    "end_seconds": 451.279,
    "text": "for this tool that I've just shared in this video."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:31.279",
    "end": "00:07:33.340",
    "start_seconds": 451.279,
    "end_seconds": 453.34000000000003,
    "text": "It was awesome hanging out in cyber space with you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:33.340",
    "end": "00:07:33.960",
    "start_seconds": 453.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 453.96,
    "text": "Have an awesome day."
  }
]
